    "html": "<p>An object undergoes simple harmonic motion. The table shows the acceleration <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"a\"></span> of the object at two different displacements <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span>.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Displacement <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span> / <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\text{m}\"></span></th><th>Acceleration <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"a\"></span> / <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\text{m s}^{-2}\"></span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"+0.20\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-5.0\"></span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-0.40\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"+10.0\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What is the angular frequency of the oscillation?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.5\\text{ rad s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5.0\\text{ rad s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"25\\text{ rad s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"50\\text{ rad s}^{-1}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
